{
  "_comment": "Branch ruleset — ENFORCE mode (graduation).",
  "_doc": [
    "Enforce mode BLOCKS merges that violate the rules. Only flip to",
    "this after every required check has run on at least one PR — if",
    "a required check name doesn't bind to a real workflow job, every",
    "PR will be unmergeable.",
    "",
    "Differences from evaluate mode:",
    "  * `enforcement: active`",
    "  * `require_code_owner_review: true`",
    "  * `required_linear_history: true`",
    "",
    "Signed commits are NOT required in the baseline. The Copilot",
    "coding agent does not currently sign its commits, and requiring",
    "signatures would break the agent loop. Signed-commit enforcement",
    "lives in `examples/public-oss-hardening/` instead.",
    "",
    "To import:",
    "  gh api -X POST /repos/<owner>/<repo>/rulesets \\",
    "    --input .github/rulesets/main-branch-enforce.json"
  ],
  "name": "main — enforce",
  "target": "branch",
  "enforcement": "active",
  "conditions": {
    "ref_name": {
      "include": ["~DEFAULT_BRANCH"],
      "exclude": []
    }
  },
  "bypass_actors": [],
  "rules": [
    { "type": "deletion" },
    { "type": "non_fast_forward" },
    { "type": "required_linear_history" },
    {
      "type": "pull_request",
      "parameters": {
        "required_approving_review_count": 1,
        "dismiss_stale_reviews_on_push": true,
        "require_code_owner_review": true,
        "require_last_push_approval": true,
        "required_review_thread_resolution": true,
        "automatic_copilot_code_review_enabled": false,
        "allowed_merge_methods": ["squash"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "required_status_checks",
      "parameters": {
        "strict_required_status_checks_policy": true,
        "do_not_enforce_on_create": true,
        "required_status_checks": [
          { "context": "app — lint + tests + audit" },
          { "context": "terraform — fmt + validate (infra/bootstrap)" },
          { "context": "terraform — fmt + validate (infra/app)" },
          { "context": "terraform — fmt + validate (examples/azure-container-apps/infra/app)" },
          { "context": "docker — lint + scan + health smoke" },
          { "context": "repository — harness + workflows + shell + JSON" },
          { "context": "Analyze (javascript-typescript)" },
          { "context": "apm install + audit" },
          { "context": "Review dependency changes" }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
